From: Trần Phát Đạt (Steve Dat) <https://github.com/stevedat/VieLotus-IM>
Subject: [PATCH] data/pkg_depends: Register Sen Việt (vielotus) for Vietnamese (vi)

Registers `vielotus` (`ibus-vielotus` and `fcitx5-vielotus`) in Ubuntu's
`language-selector-common` dependency table (`data/pkg_depends`) so selecting
Vietnamese (`vi`) in Ubuntu Language Support automatically installs Sen Việt
for both IBus and Fcitx5 desktops.
---
 data/pkg_depends | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/data/pkg_depends b/data/pkg_depends
index 8a91e42..f30b19c 100644
--- a/data/pkg_depends
+++ b/data/pkg_depends
@@ -143,6 +143,9 @@ im:th::gtk-im-libthai
 im:th::gtk3-im-libthai
 
 im:vi::ibus-unikey
+im:vi::vielotus
+im:vi:fcitx5:fcitx5-vielotus
+im:vi:ibus:ibus-vielotus
 
 im:zh-hans::fcitx5-frontend-gtk2
 im:zh-hans::fcitx5-frontend-gtk3
-- 
2.43.0
